{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather, hunt</strong>, and <strong>craft</strong> to survive in the harsh western wilderness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the vibrant, atmospheric but dangerous Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> harsh weather conditions and battle the unforgiving elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> camps, craft better equipment and carve out a new life in the west</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish</strong> in the beautiful lakes and rivers of Red Rust Valley</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong> and harvest crops and grow food to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong> solo in <strong>singleplayer</strong> or in up to <strong>4 player co-op multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rust Pioneers combines the survival mechanics of <i>ARK: Survival Evolved</i>, <i>The Forest</i>, <i>7 Days to Die</i>, <i>Valheim</i> and <i>Rust </i>with the Wild West environments<i> of Red Dead Redemption 2 and Outlaws of the Old West.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story begins stranded in the unforgiving wilderness of the Wild West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one goal: to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure scorching days and freezing nights as you battle hunger, thirst, and the elements. Forage for food, hunt wildlife, and fish to stay alive. Scavenge the land to gather vital resources and craft the tools and weapons you\u2019ll need to stand a chance in this brutal but breathtaking frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the elements and withstand blistering heat, violent rainstorms and freezing cold winters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you beat the odds and live, alone or with up to three friends, you\u2019ll find yourself in a gorgeous, rugged, vibrant land. Will you be able to not only survive, but thrive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and grow your camp your way with easy to use base building mechanics. Fish in the lakes and rivers, or hunt in the atmospheric woodlands and open prairies. Farm and harvest a variety of crops to establish a self-sufficient camp. Adventure high into the mountains to mine resources, and craft better weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully realized, open world, fictionalized Wild West frontier and become the first to discover the untamed wilderness of Red Rust Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can overcome the threat of extreme hunger, brutal weather conditions and lethal wildlife you may just live to appreciate it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664440?t=1764612202","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664440?t=1764612202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/2f57853170b31b5640224d9e6f9755c9a4b9b655/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764612202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/2f57853170b31b5640224d9e6f9755c9a4b9b655/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764612202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather, hunt</strong>, and <strong>craft</strong> to survive in the harsh western wilderness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the vibrant, atmospheric but dangerous Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> harsh weather conditions and battle the unforgiving elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> camps, craft better equipment and carve out a new life in the west</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish</strong> in the beautiful lakes and rivers of Red Rust Valley</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong> and harvest crops and grow food to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong> solo in <strong>singleplayer</strong> or in up to <strong>4 player co-op multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Rust Pioneers combines the survival mechanics of <i>ARK: Survival Evolved</i>, <i>The Forest</i>, <i>7 Days to Die</i>, <i>Valheim</i> and <i>Rust </i>with the Wild West environments<i> of Red Dead Redemption 2 and Outlaws of the Old West.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/4d4b657273fc54a12d3b003092bc0f80.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story begins stranded in the unforgiving wilderness of the Wild West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one goal: to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure scorching days and freezing nights as you battle hunger, thirst, and the elements. Forage for food, hunt wildlife, and fish to stay alive. Scavenge the land to gather vital resources and craft the tools and weapons you\u2019ll need to stand a chance in this brutal but breathtaking frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the elements and withstand blistering heat, violent rainstorms and freezing cold winters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/fa714118c8550ff1f0ae91c8daacfb13.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you beat the odds and live, alone or with up to three friends, you\u2019ll find yourself in a gorgeous, rugged, vibrant land. Will you be able to not only survive, but thrive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and grow your camp your way with easy to use base building mechanics. Fish in the lakes and rivers, or hunt in the atmospheric woodlands and open prairies. Farm and harvest a variety of crops to establish a self-sufficient camp. Adventure high into the mountains to mine resources, and craft better weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.poster.avif?t=1764612202\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.webm?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/9c3c0e1411ae340c34b93b2a98af3347.mp4?t=1764612202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><